WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.381 --> 00:00:01.780
- You kinda was giving a little kids

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:03.289
in the sandbox a side eye.

00:00:03.289 --> 00:00:05.181
Like bro, you better not leave that toy

00:00:05.181 --> 00:00:07.200
'cause it might not be
there when you get back.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.700
(light music)

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:14.931
- Today we are here to
try McDonald's Happy Meals

00:00:14.931 --> 00:00:16.152
for the very first time.

00:00:16.152 --> 00:00:18.152
- When I was little, my
parents never really took me

00:00:18.152 --> 00:00:19.741
to a lot of fast food restaurants.

00:00:19.741 --> 00:00:21.013
- I don't know what to
expect what I'm getting

00:00:21.013 --> 00:00:21.846
from a Happy Meal.

00:00:21.846 --> 00:00:22.679
I know what the food tastes like.

00:00:22.679 --> 00:00:23.815
Now I've had McDonald's.

00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:25.195
Will it taste a little sweeter?

00:00:25.195 --> 00:00:26.426
- I feel like I'm getting a gift.

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:28.837
I had a choice of apple juice,
milk, or chocolate milk.

00:00:28.837 --> 00:00:30.516
- I (beeps) love chocolate milk.

00:00:30.516 --> 00:00:32.527
It is my favorite drink of all time.

00:00:32.527 --> 00:00:35.375
- Should I wait 'til
I eat to open the toy?

00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:36.978
That's like --

00:00:36.978 --> 00:00:39.538
- There's always like
loose food like a fry.

00:00:39.538 --> 00:00:40.877
You know you always get the
loose ones at the bottom

00:00:40.877 --> 00:00:42.884
of the bag, but to get
it in a cup like this.

00:00:42.884 --> 00:00:43.717
This is great.

00:00:43.717 --> 00:00:45.721
- Oh, it's like 3D, kinda trippy.

00:00:45.721 --> 00:00:47.300
- Oh, this is a Transformer toy.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:51.341
So I don't know if I should
be starting with this.

00:00:51.341 --> 00:00:53.313
(laughs)

00:00:53.313 --> 00:00:54.335
That was good.

00:00:54.335 --> 00:00:56.423
- So all it is is a cup with a sticker.

00:00:56.423 --> 00:00:57.482
I can go to Legoland.

00:00:57.482 --> 00:00:58.623
Kids can go free.

00:00:58.623 --> 00:00:59.456
Okay cool.

00:00:59.456 --> 00:01:00.289
I don't have any kids.

00:01:00.289 --> 00:01:01.122
- Look at that.

00:01:01.122 --> 00:01:02.655
That looks great.

00:01:02.655 --> 00:01:03.895
- Life is so simple.

00:01:03.895 --> 00:01:06.393
You just come home, do a little
homework, just hop into bed,

00:01:06.393 --> 00:01:07.853
and just be watching cartoons.

00:01:07.853 --> 00:01:09.023
- Yeah, I used my toy, which again,

00:01:09.023 --> 00:01:11.592
now this defeats the
purpose of calling it a toy.

00:01:11.592 --> 00:01:13.263
- My parents would be pissed
if they saw me eating this,

00:01:13.263 --> 00:01:14.284
but it's good.

00:01:14.284 --> 00:01:15.953
And I'm gonna eat the whole thing.

00:01:15.953 --> 00:01:18.095
- This is like the cutest little fry ever.

00:01:18.095 --> 00:01:18.928
Look at that.

00:01:18.928 --> 00:01:20.214
In the palm of my hand.

00:01:20.214 --> 00:01:25.164
I'm just gonna down these
fries 'cause this is easy.

00:01:25.164 --> 00:01:28.702
I'm more intrigued with this
than I am and this stupid cup.

00:01:28.702 --> 00:01:30.423
- I love a good soggy fry.

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:33.722
As long as it's hot and
it's got a nice crunch

00:01:33.722 --> 00:01:36.673
to sog to salt ratio, we're good.

00:01:36.673 --> 00:01:38.713
- These are so cute, so small.

00:01:38.713 --> 00:01:40.244
It's nice that they cut it out like this.

00:01:40.244 --> 00:01:42.124
My mom used to cut out apples like this

00:01:42.124 --> 00:01:43.903
so it was easier to eat.

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:46.452
- All you want was the Happy
Meal because it had a cool toy.

00:01:46.452 --> 00:01:48.943
Well, it was like a Disney
princess or a Hot Wheel.

00:01:48.943 --> 00:01:50.615
This is a (beeps) cup.

00:01:50.615 --> 00:01:51.448
I'm really sorry.

00:01:51.448 --> 00:01:52.975
This is not a toy.

00:01:52.975 --> 00:01:54.934
I might just sound like
a whiny jerk right now.

00:01:54.934 --> 00:01:57.214
- I feel like to this day this
could still get the job done.

00:01:57.214 --> 00:01:58.853
It taught us portion control.

00:01:58.853 --> 00:02:00.372
They really had the key to success.

00:02:00.372 --> 00:02:01.846
- This has been a great experience.

00:02:01.846 --> 00:02:04.892
I would eat it again and again and again.

00:02:04.892 --> 00:02:06.754
And I would've eaten it so many times more

00:02:06.754 --> 00:02:07.771
if I could have as a kid.

00:02:07.771 --> 00:02:11.188
- I never read nutrition and stuff but --

00:02:12.057 --> 00:02:12.890
Who reads that?

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:13.723
(laughs)

00:02:13.723 --> 00:02:16.306
(lively music)

